#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Tracker-miners"
msgstr "Instalação do Tracker-miners"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you plan to run the tests, some timeouts are too short when using "
"spinning disks. There are two places where timeouts are used: first, "
"individual tests inside a group of tests have a default timeout of 10s. This"
" can be changed by setting the environment variable "
"<envar>TRACKER_TESTS_AWAIT_TIMEOUT</envar> to the desired value when running"
" the tests (see below). Second, a global timeout for a group of tests is "
"fixed at configuration time. The default value in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">functional-tests</filename> directory (other directories"
" have only short lived tests) may be increased with the following command "
"(replace 200 with a value suitable for your machine):"
msgstr ""
"Se você planeja executar os testes, alguns tempos limite são muito curtos ao"
" usar discos giratórios. Existem dois locais onde os tempos limite são "
"usados: primeiro, os testes individuais dentro de um grupo de testes tem um "
"tempo limite padrão de 10s. Isso pode ser mudado configurando-se a variável "
"de ambiente <envar>TRACKER_TESTS_AWAIT_TIMEOUT</envar> para o valor desejado"
" ao executar os testes (veja-se abaixo). Segundo, um tempo limite global "
"para um grupo de testes é fixado ao tempo da configuração. O valor padrão no"
" diretório <filename class=\"directory\">functional-tests</filename> (outros"
" diretórios tem somente testes de curta duração) pode ser aumentado com o "
"seguinte comando (substitua 200 por um valor adequado para a tua máquina):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i s/120/<replaceable>200</replaceable>/ tests/functional-"
"tests/meson.build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i s/120/<replaceable>200</replaceable>/ tests/functional-"
"tests/meson.build</userinput>"

#.  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/tracker-miners/-/issues/252 and
#.       https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/tracker-miners/-/issues/299
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix some crashes introduced by gstreamer-1.22.9:"
msgstr "Primeiro, corrija algumas quebras introduzidas por gstreamer-1.22.9:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/ALLOW_RULE (shutdown);/a ALLOW_RULE "
"(getsockopt);' src/libtracker-miners-common/tracker-seccomp.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/ALLOW_RULE (shutdown);/a ALLOW_RULE "
"(getsockopt);' src/libtracker-miners-common/tracker-seccomp.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Tracker-miners</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Tracker-miners</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -Dman=false         \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -Dman=false         \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:176
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr                 \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release           \\\n"
"            -Dsystemd_user_services=false \\\n"
"            -Dman=false                   \\\n"
"            ..                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr                 \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release           \\\n"
"            -Dsystemd_user_services=false \\\n"
"            -Dman=false                   \\\n"
"            ..                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#.  Some tests fail in 3.6.1 due to seccomp sandbox changes.
#.       See https://github.blog/2023-10-09-coordinated-disclosure-1-click-
#. rce-on-gnome-cve-2023-43641/
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue (adjust the individual test timeout to a value "
"suitable for your machine, see the note above):"
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita (ajuste o tempo limite do teste individual "
"para um valor adequado para a tua máquina; veja-se a nota acima):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:193
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>dbus-run-session env TRACKER_TESTS_AWAIT_TIMEOUT=<replaceable>20</replaceable> ninja test &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -rf ~/tracker-tests</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>dbus-run-session env TRACKER_TESTS_AWAIT_TIMEOUT=<replaceable>20</replaceable> ninja test &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -rf ~/tracker-tests</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests create files in the user directory (up to 24 MB), so they have to "
"be removed afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Os testes criam arquivos no diretório do(a) usuário(a) (até 24 MB), de forma"
" que eles tem de ser removidos posteriormente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:204
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:207
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dman=false</parameter>: This switch prevents the build process "
"from generating man pages. Omit this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"asciidoc\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to generate and "
"install the man pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dman=false</parameter>: Essa chave evita que o processo de "
"construção gere páginas de manual. Omita essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"asciidoc\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar gerar e instalar "
"as páginas de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd_user_services=false</parameter>: This switch prevents "
"the build process from installing systemd units since they are useless on "
"SysV systems."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemd_user_services=false</parameter>: Essa chave impede que "
"o processo de construção instale unidades do systemd, pois elas são inúteis "
"em sistemas SysV."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dseccomp=false</option>: This option disables the seccomp system "
"call filter. On some architectures, such as i686 and ARM, the functions that"
" tracker-miners uses are not guarded properly, and tracker-miners will get "
"killed with a SIGSYS as a result."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dseccomp=false</option>: Essa opção desabilita o filtro de chamada "
"de sistema seccomp. Em algumas arquiteturas, como i686 e ARM, as funções que"
" o tracker-miners usa não são protegidas adequadamente e, como resultado, o "
"tracker-miners será morto com um SIGSYS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dminer_rss=false</option>: Use this option if you have not "
"installed the recommended dependency libgrss."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dminer_rss=false</option>: Use essa opção se você não tiver "
"instalado a dependência recomendada libgrss."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/tracker3-miners.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dbattery_detection=none</option>: Use this option if you have not "
"installed the recommended dependency upower.  Do not use this option if your"
" system has a battery (laptop battery or UPS), or tracker miners may waste "
"the battery power and lifespan when the A/C power is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dbattery_detection=none</option>: Use essa opção se você não tiver "
"instalado a dependência recomendada, upower. Não use essa opção se teu "
"sistema tiver uma bateria (bateria de laptop ou UPS), ou os rastreadores "
"mineradores poderão desperdiçar a eletricidade e a vida útil da bateria "
"quando a eletricidade C/A não estiver disponível."

